---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { topics } from "../data/topics";
import { reproProjects } from "../data/repro";
import { url } from "../lib/url";

const groups = topics.map((topic) => ({
  topic,
  items: reproProjects.filter((project) => project.topic === topic.slug),
}));
const totalSteps = reproProjects.reduce((sum, project) => sum + project.steps.length, 0);
---

<BaseLayout title="论文复现" description="七个主题的论文复现实验清单：Gödel 编码、相继式演算、依赖向量、Cubical Agda、Catlab、Cook–Levin、CTL 模型检测、Hoare WP、单纯形、Nesterov、DPLL+DRAT、CDCL 等，含步骤、交付物与常见坑。">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Reproduction / {reproProjects.length} projects</span>
      <h1>论文复现实验清单</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        “读过”不等于“复现过”。这里每个主题有 2 个项目：读一篇经典论文，做一个最小实现，
        用测试/对拍证明它至少在一个小范围内成立，并记录与论文的差异。
      </p>
      <div class="row mt-2">
        <span class="badge">{reproProjects.length} 个项目</span>
        <span class="badge">{totalSteps} 个步骤</span>
        <span class="badge">7 个主题</span>
        <span class="badge">进度保存在本地</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="repro-nav" aria-label="复现主题导航">
    <div class="wrap">
      {groups.map(({ topic, items }) => (
        <a href={`#${topic.slug}`}>{topic.index} · {topic.title} <span>{items.length}</span></a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1.8rem;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="callout">
        <b>复现协议：</b>先读论文的摘要、主定理与实验设置；把“必须成立的最小命题”写成一句话；
        实现最小版本；用 3–10 个可手算的案例对拍；最后写“差异报告”：哪些假设、数据、实现细节无法复现。
        不要一开始就追求论文的完整规模。
      </div>

      {groups.map(({ topic, items }) => (
        <section class="repro-group" id={topic.slug} style={`--topic:${topic.accent}`}>
          <div class="section-title">
            <span class="n">{topic.index}</span>
            <h2>{topic.title}</h2>
            <span class="aside">{items.length} 个项目</span>
          </div>
          <div class="repro-grid">
            {items.map((project, index) => (
              <article class="repro-card" data-repro-id={project.id}>
                <div class="repro-head">
                  <span class="repro-num">R-{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
                  <div>
                    <h3>{project.title}</h3>
                    <div class="repro-paper">
                      对应阅读：<a href={project.paperUrl} rel="noopener">{project.paper}（{project.year}）↗</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="repro-goal">{project.goal}</p>
                <div class="row">
                  {project.prereq.map((item) => <span class="badge">{item}</span>)}
                </div>
                <div class="repro-steps">
                  {project.steps.map((step, stepIndex) => (
                    <label class="repro-step">
                      <input type="checkbox" data-step={stepIndex} />
                      <span>{step}</span>
                    </label>
                  ))}
                </div>
                <div class="repro-progress">
                  <span data-repro-text>0 / {project.steps.length}</span>
                  <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" data-repro-fill></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="repro-deliverable"><b>Deliverable</b>{project.deliverable}</div>
                <div class="repro-pitfalls">
                  <b>常见坑</b>
                  <ul>{project.pitfalls.map((pitfall) => <li>{pitfall}</li>)}</ul>
                </div>
                {project.stretch && <p class="repro-stretch"><b>延伸</b>{project.stretch}</p>}
                <div class="repro-tools">
                  {project.tools.map((tool) => <a href={tool.url} rel="noopener">{tool.name} ↗</a>)}
                </div>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="repro-more">
            <a href={url(`/topics/${topic.slug}/#papers`)}>回到 {topic.title} 的论文导读 →</a>
          </p>
        </section>
      ))}

      <div class="callout mt-4">
        <b>完成标准：</b>不是“代码能跑”，而是你能说清楚：最小命题是什么、测试覆盖了哪些边界、
        与论文的差异在哪里、下一个最小实验是什么。把这三件事写进 README，比多写 500 行代码更有价值。
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    import "../scripts/repro";
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
